AI Model is any trained machine learning/deep learning system. LLM is an AI model specialized for understanding and generating text. RAG provides external knowledge to an LLM at runtime, and LangChain is a framework that connects LLMs, RAG, tools, APIs, and agents to build complete AI applications.



AI Model = Your brain
LLM = Your language and coding knowledge
RAG = Your ability to look up documentation before answering
LangChain = The workflow/toolset that helps you use your brain, docs, APIs, and tools together


